      "noticedAt": "2026-09-22",
      "status": "narrowed",
      "resolutionKind": "existing-evidence",
      "evidenceNodeIds": [
        "e-omicron-prison-infectiousness"
      ],
      "note": "Omicron, 35 prisons: vaccination cut an infected person's risk of infecting contacts by 22%, both vaccine and prior infection by 40%. Empirical half settled; how much is enough stays a value fork.",
