      "status": "narrowed",
      "resolutionKind": "existing-evidence",
      "evidenceNodeIds": [
        "e-certificates-six-countries"
      ],
      "note": "Six-country synthetic control: certificates raised uptake from 20 days before to 40 days after, more where uptake was low; no effect in Germany. Covers access certificates, not general mandates.",
